  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You may select the following acclimation benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Environmental Protection:</strong> Acclimated targets gain either cold resistance or fire resistance equal to your ranks in one of your associated skills and are considered acclimated to any altitude for 24 hours. Energy resistance gained from this ability does not stack with other forms of energy resistance.</li>\n<li><strong>Immunization:</strong> Acclimated targets gain a +2 competence bonus on all saving throws against poisons, diseases, and the distraction ability of swarms. For every 8 ranks you possess in one of your associated skills, these bonuses increase by 1.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/navigation#toc32\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
